                "Toss the roasted cubes with a squeeze of lime juice and chopped cilantro for a quick side that leans savory instead of sweet.",
                "For deeper color contrast on the plate, leave the skins on a few cubes; the deep purple skin holds its color better than the flesh, which can fade slightly with heat.",
                "A dusting of smoked paprika or five-spice powder before roasting works well since the potato's mild, chestnut-like flavor takes on spices easily.",
