                "Scrape the dough into a greased 9x5-inch loaf pan. Wet your hands and smooth the top into an even dome shape.",
                "Cover loosely with plastic wrap or a damp towel and let rise in a warm spot for 50-60 minutes, until the dough has risen about 1 to 1.5 inches above the rim of the pan. It won't double the way wheat dough does.",
