                "In the bowl of a food processor, combine the tahini and lemon juice. Process for about 1 minute, scraping down the sides once, until the mixture is pale, thick, and creamy.",
                "Add the garlic, cumin, and salt. Process for 30 seconds more.",
                "Add the warm drained chickpeas to the processor. Process for 1-2 minutes, stopping to scrape down the sides, until the mixture is mostly smooth.",
                "With the processor running, drizzle in the olive oil, then add the ice water 1 tablespoon at a time, processing until the hummus is light, fluffy, and pale in color, about 1-2 minutes total.",
