                {
                    "question": "Is vegan food automatically healthier than non-vegan food?",
                    "answer": "Not necessarily. Many packaged vegan products like fried chips, sugary desserts, and vegan meat substitutes are highly processed and high in sodium or saturated fat despite containing no animal products.",
                },
