                {
                    "question": "Why did my dairy-free ice cream turn out icy instead of creamy?",
                    "answer": "This usually means not enough fat or stabilizer in the base. Full-fat coconut milk (not light) plus the blended cashews are what keep ice crystals small; skipping either one makes for a noticeably icier scoop.",
                },
