                "Pack the zest strips into a large clean glass jar and pour the vodka over them. Add the split vanilla bean if using. Seal the jar and store it in a cool, dark spot for 10 to 14 days, giving it a gentle shake once a day.",
                "Strain the infused vodka through a fine-mesh strainer lined with cheesecloth into a bowl, pressing lightly on the zest to release the last of the liquid, then discard the solids. The liquid should be a deep amber-orange and smell strongly of orange oil.",
