                "For extra crunch, double-dip: after the first coat of cornmeal, dip the fillet back into the buttermilk and coat a second time.",
                "Skip the cayenne or cut it in half for a milder crust that's friendlier to kids.",
                "A thermometer clipped to the pot is worth the few dollars it costs; guessing oil temperature by sight is the most common reason home-fried fish turns out greasy or raw in the middle.",
