                "Meanwhile, in a separate heavy-bottomed pot, whisk 1 cup (120g) of the cornstarch with the remaining 3/4 cup (180ml) water until smooth. Cook over medium heat, whisking constantly, until it thickens into a smooth, glossy paste, about 3-4 minutes.",
