                "Toasting the pistachios in a dry skillet for 2-3 minutes before chopping brings out more flavor than using them raw.",
                "If citric acid is on hand, 1/4 teaspoon can replace the lemon juice for a slightly sharper, more traditional tang.",
                "For a nut-free version, omit the pistachios entirely; the texture and set are unaffected.",
