                "Keep the water below about 140°F (60°C) the whole time; hotter water can scorch the honey and dull its aroma and flavor.",
                "Once liquefied, let the jar cool slightly, wipe it dry, and reseal tightly. Store at room temperature in a dry spot away from direct sunlight.",
