                "While the shanks finish braising, stir together the lemon zest, parsley, and a pinch of salt in a small bowl to make the gremolata.",
                "Remove the shanks from the pot and discard the bay leaves and thyme stems. If the sauce is thin, simmer it uncovered over medium heat for 5-10 minutes to reduce and thicken.",
