                "Preheat the oven to 425°F (220°C).",
                "Heat 1-2 tablespoons of oil in an oven-safe skillet over medium-high heat until shimmering.",
                "Sear the tenderloin on all sides, about 2 minutes per side, until deeply browned all over.",
                "Transfer the skillet directly to the oven and roast for 12-18 minutes, until an instant-read thermometer inserted into the thickest part reads 140-145°F (60-63°C).",
