                "Add a splash of pineapple juice to the marinade for extra sweetness and tenderizing enzymes, common in coastal Mexican versions.",
                "Char a few whole jalapenos or a quartered onion alongside the steak on the grill and chop them into the tacos for smoky heat.",
                "Double the marinade and use a portion as a drizzling sauce after cooking for extra brightness.",
