                "Preheat a smoker to 225°F (107°C) using apple, cherry, or pecan wood, mild fruit woods that won't overpower a lean cut like pork loin.",
                "Place the loin fat side up directly on the smoker grate and insert a leave-in probe thermometer into the thickest part, away from any fat pockets.",
