                "Assemble the packets at home the night before, refrigerate them unsealed contents-in-bag, then seal and pack them in a cooler so all that's left at the campsite is dropping them on the coals.",
                "Rotate the packets a quarter turn every 5-7 minutes if your coals are uneven, so one side doesn't scorch while the other lags behind.",
