                "While the kofta cook, stir together the yogurt, lemon juice, a small minced garlic clove, and a pinch of salt for the sauce.",
                "Let the kofta rest for 2-3 minutes off the heat, then serve warm with the yogurt sauce, extra lemon wedges, and warm flatbread if you like.",
