                "Add the gluten-free flour blend, salt, and melted butter to the yeast mixture. Mix on low speed with a dough hook (or stir vigorously by hand) for 3-4 minutes, until you get a soft, slightly sticky dough that holds together; it will not be smooth and elastic like wheat dough.",
