                {
                    "question": "What steak cuts pair best with creamed spinach?",
                    "answer": "Rich, well-marbled cuts like ribeye or New York strip balance well with the dish's creaminess, while leaner cuts like filet mignon let the sauce carry more of the flavor on the plate.",
                },
