                {
                    "question": "How do I keep iced minted tea from turning cloudy?",
                    "answer": "Let hot-brewed tea cool to room temperature before refrigerating, and avoid pouring it hot over ice; rapid temperature changes cause tannins to cloud the liquid.",
                },
