                "Bake for 45-55 minutes, until deep golden brown and crisp throughout.",
                "While the baklava bakes, combine the syrup sugar, water, honey, lemon juice, and cinnamon stick in a saucepan. Bring to a boil, then reduce heat and simmer for 10 minutes. Remove the cinnamon stick and let the syrup cool slightly.",
                "As soon as the baklava comes out of the oven, slowly pour the warm syrup evenly over the hot pastry, making sure it reaches the edges and corners.",
                "Let the baklava sit uncovered at room temperature for at least 6 hours, or overnight, so the syrup fully absorbs before serving.",
