                "Roll one dough disc between two sheets of parchment paper to about 1/8-inch thickness.",
                "Cut rounds with a 2-inch cutter and place them 1 inch apart on the prepared baking sheets. Re-roll scraps once.",
                "Bake for 9-11 minutes, until the cookies look dry and set at the edges; they will still feel soft in the center but firm up as they cool.",
                "Let the cookies cool completely on the baking sheet, at least 20 minutes, before filling.",
