                "Wrap the packet snugly in a second piece of banana leaf or parchment, then tie tightly with kitchen twine in a crisscross pattern, going around the packet twice each direction.",
                "Bring a large pot of well-salted water to a boil. Lower the pasteles in, adding enough water to fully submerge them, and weigh them down with a heatproof plate if they float.",
